coln County runs 75 years, from 1951 to 2025, across 6 grids. On the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 6 grids, January to February came in under 90% of normal in 36 of those years, and in 2026 so far it came in at 26% of normal. June to July, the wettest pair, ran 152% of normal on the middle in 2025. Every grid had its driest year in 1976, with grid 29535 at 43% of normal.</p>"}
